(7062849, 1074491, 60495, '<td valign="top">Nice drip shot, not really water so not sure how to vote, I do like the capture though, especially the little drip above the crown.</td>', 'Nice drip shot, not really water so not sure how to vote, I do like the capture though, especially the little drip above the crown.', '2013-07-09 00:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
