(7062867, 1074546, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good attempt but lacks the super crispness this type of shot needs to become a solid stock photo.  I do like the vertical take vice horizontal.</td>', 'A good attempt but lacks the super crispness this type of shot needs to become a solid stock photo.  I do like the vertical take vice horizontal.', '2013-07-09 01:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
