(7062870, 1074545, 30982, '<td valign="top">A bit on the soft-ish side for me but I do like the spray as a water drop consideration.</td>', 'A bit on the soft-ish side for me but I do like the spray as a water drop consideration.', '2013-07-09 01:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
