(7062884, 1074491, 30982, '<td valign="top">Takes a lot of work, and probably a lot of milk, to get that to look that way.  My only wish would be that the bubble on the right were not there, although it does resemble a face of sorts, which makes it look almost like a turtle.  Kinda.</td>', 'Takes a lot of work, and probably a lot of milk, to get that to look that way.  My only wish would be that the bubble on the right were not there, although it does resemble a face of sorts, which makes it look almost like a turtle.  Kinda.', '2013-07-09 01:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7062885, 1074367, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like a natural rain patter on protected wood - a deck or deck furniture perhaps?  Reminds me I still need to get patio furniture one of these days...</td>', 'Looks like a natural rain patter on protected wood - a deck or deck furniture perhaps?  Reminds me I still need to get patio furniture one of these days...', '2013-07-09 01:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
