(7070516, 1074624, 122678, '<td valign="top">Wowww top Ten! :) I''m so happy and thankful for all the support and great comments on this image. It was a memorable day spent with my daughter, one I will never forget and on top of that great lighting, who could resist. I hope anyone who loves to photograph and is in NYC will go to the Rain Room, tons of wet fun and amazing lighting! Thank you for all your support of this image and all my others.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-07-15 07:36:14.</i></td>', 'Wowww top Ten! :) I''m so happy and thankful for all the support and great comments on this image. It was a memorable day spent with my daughter, one I will never forget and on top of that great lighting, who could resist. I hope anyone who loves to photograph and is in NYC will go to the Rain Room, tons of wet fun and amazing lighting! Thank you for all your support of this image and all my others.', '2013-07-15 08:30:47.000000', '2013-07-15 08:36:14.000000', 0),
