(7070679, 1074807, 34171, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments and votes.  That is my dog Smokey and he loves to play with the water hose.  Actually, he''s a bit of a pain sometimes, since when ever we run a hose around the house, he''s there, thinking it must be play time.</td>', 'Thank you all for your comments and votes.  That is my dog Smokey and he loves to play with the water hose.  Actually, he''s a bit of a pain sometimes, since when ever we run a hose around the house, he''s there, thinking it must be play time.', '2013-07-15 12:58:55.000000', NULL, 0),
