(7071281, 1074716, 52549, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hesitant:</b></div><hr/><i> The thing I love about you Irene is that you take no prisoners! There could only be one winner. You pretend it''s hard work but you love it. Always an inspiration. Warm congrats on the win! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well it IS hard work, but you''re right, I love it... Thanks for the comment, David. It''s one of the best I''ve had.</td>', 'Originally posted by hesitant: The thing I love about you Irene is that you take no prisoners! There could only be one winner. You pretend it''s hard work but you love it. Always an inspiration. Warm congrats on the win!   Well it IS hard work, but you''re right, I love it... Thanks for the comment, David. It''s one of the best I''ve had.', '2013-07-16 10:22:33.000000', NULL, 0),
